      "comment": "EGYPTIAN QUEEN (1) was prominent throughout when winning in one of the fastest times of the card two back but could manage only midfield last time when finished 5th and beaten 5.5 lengths at this track (30.71). Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from four starts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. SIMPLICITY MAGIC (2) shapes well after a good run last time, finishing second in a Grade 4/5 at this track in 30.35. In form and looks a leading player again. UNLEASH SHIRLEY (3) stuck on well last time to finish 2 lengths back in third (23.26) at The Gardens in a Grade 4/5 over 400m. Must be included in calculations. FLAT OUT FRED (8) has strong credentials over this journey.",
